deadline of a scope opened before the mask: expired true, masked sleep finished true, unmasked sleep cancelled true
cancel of a scope opened before the mask: masked sleep finished true
deadline of a scope opened after the mask: masked sleep cancelled true, expired true
cancel of a scope opened after the mask: masked sleep cancelled true, expired false
cancel of a scope opened below the mask from the unmasked Io: masked sleep finished true
cancel of the scope enclosing the mask, under a scope opened below it from the unmasked Io: masked sleep finished true
unmasked sleep in a scope from the unmasked Io, under no masked scope: cancelled true, expired false
unmasked sleep in a scope from the unmasked Io, inside a masked scope: finished true
bounded shutdown: flushed true, gave up true, timed out true
